#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
wm-grok-fleet — High-Throughput Atomic Fleet Orchestrator for Grok 4.7+ (`cursor-agent`).

Key architectural invariants:
- SQLite WAL queue on ext4 (`~/.local/share/whitemagic/grok_fleet/fleet.db`) so locking works reliably.
- Bulk artifacts (stream logs, full outputs, patches, SCITT receipts) stored on SD_CARD1 when available.
- Stream-JSON NDJSON incremental capture + dual timers (inactivity stall watchdog + wall ceiling).
- Standard non-fast model resolution by default (`WM_GROK_FAMILY`, ready for grok-4.8+).
- Worktree harvest + optional `bwrap` confined verification via `wm-grok-swarm` + immediate prune.
- Host RAM/disk governor + shared 429 exponential backoff.
- Never passes `--approve-mcps` (zero `wm3` SQLite contention).
"""

